  ButtonBox["TrainSegmentationNetwork",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/TrainSegmentationNetwork"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"511db2c1-199b-3540-b71a-26742b461a34"],
 ". Multi channel training is not yet implemented and the option currently \
has no effect. Networks always have a single input channel, for 4D training \
data a random channel is selected for each sample."
}], "Usage",
